                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | go  | 1.18.10  | 1.20.10,1.21.3  | binary  | /usr/local/go/bin/go  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2023-44487](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44487)  |\n"
