            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-38408-openssh-client",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-38408 critical vulnerability for openssh-client package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The PKCS#11 feature in ssh-agent in OpenSSH before 9.3p2 has an insufficiently trustworthy search path, leading to remote code execution if an agent is forwarded to an attacker-controlled system. (Code in /usr/lib is not necessarily safe for loading into ssh-agent.) NOTE: this issue exists because of an incomplete fix for CVE-2016-10009."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-38408",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-38408\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: openssh-client\nVersion: 1:8.4p1-5+deb11u1\nFix Version: 1:8.4p1-5+deb11u2\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2023-38408](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-38408)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-38408**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | openssh-client  | 1:8.4p1-5+deb11u1  | 1:8.4p1-5+deb11u2  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2023-38408](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-38408)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
