                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-32002**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | git-man  | 1:2.30.2-1  | 1:2.30.2-1+deb11u3  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2024-32002](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-32002)  |\n"
