            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-4304-libssl1.1",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-4304 medium vulnerability for libssl1.1 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A timing based side channel exists in the OpenSSL RSA Decryption implementation which could be sufficient to recover a plaintext across a network in a Bleichenbacher style attack. To achieve a successful decryption an attacker would have to be able to send a very large number of trial messages for decryption. The vulnerability affects all RSA padding modes: PKCS#1 v1.5, RSA-OEAP and RSASVE.  For example, in a TLS connection, RSA is commonly used by a client to send an encrypted pre-master secret to the server. An attacker that had observed a genuine connection between a client and a server could use this flaw to send trial messages to the server and record the time taken to process them. After a sufficiently large number of messages the attacker could recover the pre-master secret used for the original connection and thus be able to decrypt the application data sent over that connection."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2022-4304",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-4304\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libssl1.1\nVersion: 1.1.1n-0+deb11u3\nFix Version: 1.1.1n-0+deb11u4\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2022-4304](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2022-4304)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-4304**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libssl1.1  | 1.1.1n-0+deb11u3  | 1.1.1n-0+deb11u4  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2022-4304](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2022-4304)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/libssl1.1@1.1.1n-0%2Bdeb11u3?arch=arm64\u0026distro=debian-11.6\u0026upstream=openssl"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.9"
              }
            },
