                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-24538\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.18.10\nFix Version: 1.19.8,1.20.3\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/local/go/pkg/tool/linux_arm64/pprof\nData Namespace: govulndb:language:go\nLink: [CVE-2023-24538](https://go.dev/issue/59234)",
