                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2021-31525\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: golang.org/x/net\nVersion: v0.0.0-20210226172049-e18ecbb05110\nFix Version: 0.0.0-20210428140749-89ef3d95e781\nType: go-module\nLocation: /app/hello-server\nData Namespace: github:language:go\nLink: [CVE-2021-31525](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-h86h-8ppg-mxmh)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2021-31525**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | golang.org/x/net  | v0.0.0-20210226172049-e18ecbb05110  | 0.0.0-20210428140749-89ef3d95e781  | go-module  | /app/hello-server  | github:language:go  | [CVE-2021-31525](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-h86h-8ppg-mxmh)  |\n"
