                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-12243\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libgnutls30\nVersion: 3.7.1-5+deb11u2\nFix Version: 3.7.1-5+deb11u7\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2024-12243](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-12243)",
