                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-7383**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | libssl1.1  | 1.1.1n-0+deb11u3  | 1.1.1w-0+deb11u8  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2026-7383](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-7383)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/libssl1.1@1.1.1n-0%2Bdeb11u3?arch=arm64\u0026distro=debian-11.6\u0026upstream=openssl"
