            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-57433-libperl5.32",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-57433 critical vulnerability for libperl5.32 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Storable versions before 3.41 for Perl have a signed integer overflow when deserializing a crafted SX_HOOK record.  retrieve_hook_common reads a signed 32-bit item count from an SX_HOOK record and calls av_extend with that count plus one. A count of I32_MAX wraps the addition to a negative value.  A crafted blob passed to thaw or retrieve triggers the overflow; av_extend receives the negative count and dies with a panic, terminating the deserialization."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-57433",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-57433\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: libperl5.32\nVersion: 5.32.1-4+deb11u2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2026-57433](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-57433)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-57433**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | libperl5.32  | 5.32.1-4+deb11u2  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2026-57433](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-57433)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/libperl5.32@5.32.1-4%2Bdeb11u2?arch=arm64\u0026distro=debian-11.6\u0026upstream=perl"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.8"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-57433-perl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-57433 critical vulnerability for perl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Storable versions before 3.41 for Perl have a signed integer overflow when deserializing a crafted SX_HOOK record.  retrieve_hook_common reads a signed 32-bit item count from an SX_HOOK record and calls av_extend with that count plus one. A count of I32_MAX wraps the addition to a negative value.  A crafted blob passed to thaw or retrieve triggers the overflow; av_extend receives the negative count and dies with a panic, terminating the deserialization."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-57433",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-57433\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: perl\nVersion: 5.32.1-4+deb11u2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2026-57433](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-57433)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-57433**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | perl  | 5.32.1-4+deb11u2  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2026-57433](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-57433)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/perl@5.32.1-4%2Bdeb11u2?arch=arm64\u0026distro=debian-11.6"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.8"
              }
