            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-13221-libperl5.32",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-13221 critical vulnerability for libperl5.32 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Perl versions through 5.43.9 produce silently incorrect regular expression matches when an alternation of more than 65535 fixed string branches is compiled into a trie in Perl_study_chunk.  When such branches are combined into a trie, the delta between the first branch and the shared tail is stored in a 16-bit field. A branch count above 65535 overflows the field, and the trie's match decision table is truncated with no warning or error.  A pattern of this shape produces false positive matches (matching strings it should not) and false negative matches (failing to match strings it should). When such a pattern gates an access or filtering decision, the result is wrong."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-13221",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-13221\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: libperl5.32\nVersion: 5.32.1-4+deb11u2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2026-13221](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-13221)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-13221**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | libperl5.32  | 5.32.1-4+deb11u2  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2026-13221](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-13221)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/libperl5.32@5.32.1-4%2Bdeb11u2?arch=arm64\u0026distro=debian-11.6\u0026upstream=perl"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.1"
              }
            },
