                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-6395**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libgnutls30  | 3.7.1-5+deb11u2  | 3.7.1-5+deb11u8  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2025-6395](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2025-6395)  |\n"
