                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-25815\nSeverity: low\nPackage: git-man\nVersion: 1:2.30.2-1\nFix Version: 1:2.30.2-1+deb11u3\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2023-25815](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-25815)",
