              "id": "CVE-2026-39822-go",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-39822 high vulnerability for go package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "On Unix systems, opening a file in an os.Root improperly follows symlinks to locations outside of the Root when the final path component of the a path is a symbolic link and the path ends in /. For example, 'root.Open(\"symlink/\")' will open \"symlink\" even when \"symlink\" is a symbolic link pointing outside of the root."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-39822",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-39822\nSeverity: high\nPackage: go\nVersion: 1.18.10\nFix Version: 1.25.12,1.26.5,1.27.0-rc.2\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/go/bin/go\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-39822](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-39822)",
