            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-58470-wget",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-58470 medium vulnerability for wget package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "GNU Wget through 1.25.0, fixed in commit 43d3ba9, contains an integer overflow vulnerability in the parse_content_range() function within src/http.c that allows server-controlled values to cause signed integer arithmetic to overflow. Attackers can supply malicious Content-Range header values to trigger undefined behavior and download desynchronization in the affected client."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-58470",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-58470\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: wget\nVersion: 1.21-1+deb11u1\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2026-58470](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-58470)",
