              "id": "CVE-2026-56132-libexpat1",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-56132 medium vulnerability for libexpat1 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In libexpat before 2.8.2, there is a heap-based buffer overflow in doProlog in xmlparse.c because scaffold backing array reallocation is mishandled when there is data-structure sharing across parsers."
