            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-6879-libpython3.9-minimal",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-6879 low vulnerability for libpython3.9-minimal package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "`Element.findall()` and fully-consumed `Element.iterfind()` exhibit `O(n^2)` time complexity when using XPath index predicates (e.g. `[1]`, `[last()]`, `[last()-N]`) on XML documents with many same-tag siblings. `Element.find()` is only affected when the first match is near the end  of the sibling list, such as with `[last()]` or `[last()-N]`;  `.//item[1]` short-circuits after the first match."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-6879",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-6879\nSeverity: low\nPackage: libpython3.9-minimal\nVersion: 3.9.2-1\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2026-6879](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-6879)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-6879**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | libpython3.9-minimal  | 3.9.2-1  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2026-6879](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-6879)  |\n"
