            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-4032-libpython3.9-minimal",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-4032 low vulnerability for libpython3.9-minimal package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The “ipaddress” module contained incorrect information about whether certain IPv4 and IPv6 addresses were designated as “globally reachable” or “private”. This affected the is_private and is_global properties of the ipaddress.IPv4Address, ipaddress.IPv4Network, ipaddress.IPv6Address, and ipaddress.IPv6Network classes, where values wouldn’t be returned in accordance with the latest information from the IANA Special-Purpose Address Registries.  CPython 3.12.4 and 3.13.0a6 contain updated information from these registries and thus have the intended behavior."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-4032",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-4032\nSeverity: low\nPackage: libpython3.9-minimal\nVersion: 3.9.2-1\nFix Version: 3.9.2-1+deb11u2\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:11\nLink: [CVE-2024-4032](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-4032)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-4032**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | libpython3.9-minimal  | 3.9.2-1  | 3.9.2-1+deb11u2  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:11  | [CVE-2024-4032](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2024-4032)  |\n"
              },
